on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  2] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <1>
  [  4] extcall 30 .............................. moveCursor(1)
  [  6] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [  8] extcall 19 .............................. checkButtons()
  [ 10] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 12] thebuiltin 6 ............................ <the frame>
  [ 14] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <the frame>
  [ 16] extcall 7 ............................... go(the frame)
  [ 18] ret
end
